  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0 — Adds the endpoints the API documents and this SDK did not cover: wallet pay-in history, the supported-blockchains and platform-assets catalogues, the fiat and crypto currency lists, and the status/search filters on sweep history. Sweep settings gain gas_source, so a TRON wallet can be told to burn its own TRX instead of taking rented energy billed to your API credits. Fixes: gateway error codes now reach ApiException.Code, so ErrorCodes constants match; a bare-array endpoint answering an empty result yields an empty list rather than null; and the sweep fee modes and completed_at are documented as they actually behave — completed_at is stamped on failures too, so it is not proof a sweep settled.",
